---
layout: base
title: Topics
permalink: /topics/
description: "Start with curated topic hubs for cybersecurity and infosec, MSP work, IT, Windows troubleshooting, browser security, AI, and everyday defense."
---

<div class="topics-page">
  <header class="topics-page__header">
    <h1>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&#128506;&#65039;</span>
      <span>Topics</span>
    </h1>
    <p>
      Start here when you want a focused path through the site instead of a reverse-chronological archive.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="topics-grid">
    {% for topic in topicHubs %}
      <article class="topic-card" style="--topic-accent: {{ topic.accentColor }};">
        <h2 class="topic-card__title">
          <span aria-hidden="true">{{ topic.icon | safe }}</span>
          <a href="/topics/{{ topic.slug }}/">{{ topic.name }}</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="topic-card__description">{{ topic.description }}</p>
        <a class="topic-card__link" href="/topics/{{ topic.slug }}/">Browse {{ topic.name }}</a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
